  "prefLabel": "Ed 310.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 310.01 Purpose. The purpose of this rule is to offer a model physical activity policy to school boards which promotes increased physical activity for all students K-12.\n\nSource. #8317, eff 4-5-05; ss by #10361-B, eff 6-15-13; ss by #13654, eff 6-9-23",
